===== sym-severe as rendered =====
SYMPTOMS & REACTIONS
The symptom is severe, or something new and frightening is happening
Contact your care team
Contact the care team, or emergency services if it's urgent. Do that first. Logging it in the app can wait — this app has no way to judge how serious something is, and it will never try to.
STEP BY STEP
1
If the person is very unwell, struggling to breathe, confused, or you're frightened, call your local emergency number.
2
Otherwise call the care team or the on-call number they gave you.
3
Once they've been contacted, come back and log the symptom with the time it started, so there's an accurate record.
4
Use the note field to write down exactly what you saw, in your own words. That's genuinely useful to the care team later.
WORTH KNOWING
ChemoWell is a record-keeping tool, not medical advice. Never delay care because of anything shown in this app.
RELATED
